    "Compare the revised draft sentence clause by clause with the supplied current policy (eligible tier, 24-hour notice, fees for other tiers). Check any fee amount against the fee table once it is supplied.",
  ownerRole: "Content owner (Vietnamese help content)",
  effort: "small",
});

writeFileSync(outFile, JSON.stringify(bundle, null, 2) + "\n");
console.log(JSON.stringify({ reviews: bundle.reviews.length, evidence: bundle.evidence.length, findings: bundle.findings.length, now }));

